SUMMARY:The Jovial July Karaoke Mix and Mingle Party! (Wednesday\, July 15
 th)
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n\n
 Please join us for our **Jovial July Karaoke Mix and Mingle Party** where 
 we will meet at Smoke Show.\nThe Karaoke host is outstanding!\n\\-\\-\\-\\
 -\\-\n**Where and When to Meet us?**\n**Smoke Show BBQ and BREW**\n(Just m
 ention Steve from Meetup when you arrive- to find our reserved section)\n*
 *Date:** Wednesday July 15th\, 2026\n**Address:** 744 Mt. Pleasant Rd\n**A
 rrive between:** 7:30 pm and 9:30 pm (if you can)\n(Dinner Menu Provided)\
 n**Free Parking** on Eglinton and Mt. Pleasant north of Eglinton\n**Taking
  Subway:** 1 minute walk north of Mt. Pleaant and Egltinto Station\n\\-\\-
 \\-\\-\\-\n\nEvent Details below:\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer)\nmeetup.c
 om/soulcity/\n\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\nEvent Details:\n**Th
 e Jovial July Karaoke Mix and Mingle Party!**\n\n-We will meet inside and 
 patio (reserved seating) and look forward to a great night to mix\, mingle
 \, share some laughs and then Karaoke after the mixer\n\n\\*Plan to come f
 or dinner too if you like (a fabulous dinner menu)\n\\*Invite your friends
  too\; or come on your own (either way\, we're going to have a blast and m
 ake lots of new friends!)\n\\*Choose to sing or merely enjoy a super enthu
 sed energy all night long!\n**Please be courteous to the Restaurant and St
 aff:**\n**\\*One beverage and/or appetizer minimum- Thank you :)**\n\n\\-\
 \-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
 \\-\\-\\-\n**EVENT FEE and Arrival Times:**\n\n\\*Please arrive between 7:
 30 pm and 9:30 pm (if you can)\n\n**Event Fee: (Cash only at the door)**\n
 10 dollars cash or in advance by e transfer too:\n[steveflemming11@gmail.c
 om](http://steveflemming11@gmail.com/)\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\
 \-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
 \n\n\\*Free Parking on Duplex (block west of Yonge) Residential area\, wit
 h paid street parking and parking lot on Yonge street
