SUMMARY: THURSDAY (Free event) The Challenges of Modern Dating and Modern 
 Relationships 
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n\n
 (Free Online Event)\n\n\\*Joined by my other groups too :)\n\n**The Challe
 nges of Modern Dating and Modern Relationships** is a one-hour interactive
  Zoom discussion hosted and moderated by **Steve Flemming** through the **
 Soul City Social Club**. Together we'll explore the realities of dating an
 d relationships in today's fast-changing world—communication\, trust\, e
 xpectations\, loneliness\, technology\, emotional connection\, and what it
  really takes to build healthy\, lasting relationships. Whether you're sin
 gle\, dating\, married\, separated\, or simply interested in understanding
  the modern relationship landscape\, you're welcome to join this respectfu
 l\, open-minded conversation. Come to share your experiences\, listen to o
 thers\, and leave with fresh perspectives in a friendly\, supportive\, and
  judgment-free environment.\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
 \\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n\nArrival Time:\nPlease join us between 8:
 00 pm and 8:10 pm (if you can)\nThe conversation begins right away :)\n\n*
 **\n\nCamera's On Please :)\n\nHosted by Steve Flemming\nSoul City Social 
 Club\nhttps://www.meetup.com/soulcity/\nhttps://www.youtube.com/@SteveFlem
 mingSongs/videos\n\n\\*If you do wish to support and contribute to this an
 d these Thursday Night online events that include 3 plus hours of music af
 ter\; you can do so through e transfer or pay pal to steveflemming11@gmail
 .com\nYou're support and gratitude is greatly appreciated!\n\n**Zoom link:
 **\nhttps://us04web.zoom.us/j/495043928\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
 \\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n\n**Bonus:**\n**Stick around after the 
 event for Steve Flemming Presents: Songs with Heart**\nCanadian Folk and C
 ountry Artist\nhttps://www.meetup.com/soulcity/events/315628720
