DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nGood day everyone\,\
 n\nPlease join us for a great day as we mix\, mingle and enjoy **the World
  Cup Final!**\n\n\\*Joined by my other social groups too\; so we can antic
 ipate a fabulous turn out with lots of friendly peers to enjoy the big gam
 e with!\n\n**\\*Meet us inside Smoke Show between 2:00 pm and 3:00 pm**\n\
 \*Includes Mix\, Mingle and Board games at 1:00 pm and Patio Dinner Party 
 after the Soccer game at 5:30 pm :)\n\n(Event Details Below)\n\nSincerely\
 ,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)\n\nEvent Details:\n**2026 FIFA World
  Cup Final Party! (with Food and Drink Specials) (Sunday\, July 19th)**\n\
 n-A fun\, interactive\, event with friends\, food and the World Cup Finals
  Party!\n-Amazing people\, resereved seating\, great food and beverages\n(
 Lots of Big Screen TV's to catch the game)\n-Complimentary Pool Table\, an
 d Food and Drink specials too\n-Swag and prizes included :)\n\\*Plenty of 
 parking all around the venue\n-Free Parking on Mt. Pleasant north of Eglin
 ton and -Free Parking on Eglinton (Just west of Mt. Pleasant)\n\\*Stick ar
 ound after for the Patio Dinner party too :)\n\n**Friendly Reminders:**\n-
 Arrive any time between 2:00 pm and 3:30 pm inside the restaurant (ask or 
 look for Steve/Organizer when you arrive for our reserved section)\n(1 min
 ute walk from the new Eglinton station at Mt. Pleasant)\n\n**Event Fee:**\
 n10 dollars (cash only) when you arrive (HST is included)\nor e transfer i
 n advance to [Steveflemming11@gmail.com](http://Steveflemming11@gmail.com/
 )\n(One Beverage or Appetizer Minimum please to support the staff and rest
 aurant)\nFee includes Board Games event\, the Soccer Match and the Patio D
 inner Party after the game :)
